  "description": "IGODEO crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H121 Eu9 O42,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2C (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2A (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2B (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3C (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3A (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3B (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.668-5.235 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.14-168.08°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C80H123Eu9O43. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ4-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
